WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.504
Uncle Máximo!

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:04.463
Hugo!

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:07.299
I've decided to tell you my life story.

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:10.302
It all starts in Acapulco.

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:13.972
This was the deciding moment in my life.

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:16.016
For a poor kid
from the streets of Acapulco,

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.894
the way to a better life
was a job at Las Colinas,

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:21.188
the most glamorous resort of all.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.319
I'm Diane, the owner of Las Colinas.

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:31.949
Welcome to our hotel.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.414
Promise me you're
not gonna let that place change you.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:40.874
I can't believe I'm sitting here.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:44.461
I can't believe I'm sitting anywhere.
My family just has the one chair.

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:47.589
This is where all the action is.

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:51.802
One mistake, and your career here
will be over. Good luck, papi.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:56.807
So I just served filet mignon
to a dog. Is that normal here?

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.350
More normal than you'd think.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.521
Máximo, if you wanna keep this job,

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.357
maybe don't hit on the boss's girlfriend.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.112
I had this idea of what
it'd be like working at a place like this.

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:13.031
But I'm not sure I feel comfortable here.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:15.742
I know that whatever happens there,

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:17.411
you're only doing it
so we can have a better life.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.458
Every dream has its price.
Are you willing to risk it?

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.836
You come home
super late at night smelling like shame.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:28.005
I already told you that smell is chlorine.

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:34.720
My mother was afraid
the resort would change me. But maybe...

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:39.016
it would be the other way around.

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:41.393
No more dreaming, Memo.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.689
From here on out,
we're making our dreams come true.

